        "Respiration of marine phytoplankton releasing O₃"
      ],
      correct: 1,
      exp: "High-energy UV photons split molecular oxygen ($O_2 \\xrightarrow{UV} O + O$). A free nascent oxygen atom ($O$) combines with an oxygen molecule ($O + O_2 \\to O_3$) to generate stratospheric ozone."
    },
